{
  "name": "WeekPicker",
  "group": "forms",
  "description": "Selector de semana ISO 8601: elegir un día elige su semana (lunes a domingo), con el número de semana visible. Valor YYYY-Www, como <input type=\"week\">.",
  "import": "import { WeekPicker } from \"@zuccadev-labs/zuix-zui\"",
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "value",
      "type": "string | null"
    },
    {
      "name": "defaultValue",
      "type": "string | null"
    },
    {
      "name": "onValueChange",
      "type": "(value: string | null) => void"
    },
    {
      "name": "min",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "max",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "locale",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "placeholder",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "required",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "enum",
      "values": [
        "sm",
        "md",
        "lg"
      ],
      "default": "md"
    },
    {
      "name": "...DatePicker",
      "type": "DatePickerProps",
      "description": "El resto de props de DatePicker."
    },
    {
      "name": "weekLabel",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "Week"
    }
  ],
  "states": [
    "rest",
    "hover",
    "focus",
    "open",
    "disabled",
    "invalid"
  ],
  "tokens": [
    "accent",
    "accent-ring",
    "accent-soft",
    "calendar-cell",
    "control-bg",
    "control-border",
    "control-border-hover",
    "control-height-lg",
    "control-height-md",
    "control-height-sm",
    "control-radius",
    "danger",
    "duration-fast",
    "ease-standard",
    "fg",
    "fg-muted",
    "fg-subtle",
    "focus-width",
    "leading-snug",
    "line-strong",
    "popup-bg",
    "popup-radius",
    "radius-full",
    "row-hover",
    "space-2",
    "space-3",
    "space-8",
    "surface",
    "surface-3",
    "text-body",
    "text-caption",
    "text-small",
    "text-title",
    "weight-medium",
    "weight-semibold"
  ],
  "classes": [
    "z-datepicker",
    "z-calendar"
  ],
  "a11y": "Pasar el puntero o el foco por un día resalta su semana; Intro la elige. La columna del número de semana es th scope=row con «Week N». Sin React: data-selection-unit=\"week\" data-week-start=\"1\" data-week-numbers; el valor del campo oculto es YYYY-Www.",
  "behavior": "dom",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Semana del informe",
      "code": "<WeekPicker aria-label=\"Report week\" locale=\"en-GB\" defaultValue=\"2026-W47\" />"
    }
  ],
  "html": [
    {
      "title": "Semana del informe",
      "code": "<span class=\"z-select z-datepicker\" id=\"report-week\" data-size=\"md\" data-block data-selection-unit=\"week\" data-week-start=\"1\" data-week-numbers data-locale=\"en-GB\" data-value=\"2026-W47\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"z-select__control\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"report-week-panel\" data-state=\"closed\">\n    <span class=\"z-sr-only\">Report week</span>\n    <span class=\"z-select__value\">Week 47, 2026</span>\n  </button>\n  <span class=\"z-select__chevron\"><z-icon name=\"calendar\" size=\"16\"></z-icon></span>\n  <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"report-week\" value=\"2026-W47\" />\n</span>\n\n<div id=\"report-week-panel\" popover=\"manual\" class=\"z-liquid z-popover z-datepicker__panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Choose week\">\n  <div class=\"z-calendar\"></div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "origin": "Week Picker de Shark UI."
}
